    <div class="grid-x align-justify max-width">

            <main id="main-content" class="cell section-detail-main small-12">
                <div class="inner-content">
                    <h1>Design and construction standards</h1>
                        <div class="body-copy-wrapper" >
<p></p>
<p></p>
    </div>







<!-- start: panel & form component -->
    <div class="form-panel form-panel-header-image">

        
        <!-- start: header image -->
            <div class="js-background-image ratio--3-1">
                <img src="https://www.unr.edu/main/images/divisions/administration-finance/facilities/components/blueprints.jpg" alt="Close-up image of blueprints" class="lazy" data-original="https://www.unr.edu/main/images/divisions/administration-finance/facilities/components/blueprints.jpg"  width="1201" height="472"/>
            </div>
        <!-- end: header image -->
        <!-- start: component description area -->
        <div class="component-description text-left">
            <div class="maxwidth-896">
                <!-- component title -->
                <!-- component description -->
                <p>
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <!-- end: component area -->
        <!-- start: panel content -->
        <div class="grid-x align-center component-maxwidth">
            <!-- start: content information -->
            <div class="cell small-12 medium-12 large-6 medium-order-1">
                <div class="panel-side-content">
                    <p>The Design and Construction Standards are a compilation of standards developed by the University of Nevada, Reno Facilities Services Department and State of Nevada Public Works Division. These standards are reviewed and updated annually or as needed and posted here, with the most recent updates made in October 2025.</p>
<p><strong>Download Design and Construction Standards documents:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li><a href="https://nevada.box.com/s/jezztzmz94185fz2gxgzn8fi1q5f5ob9" class="extLink"><strong>Design and Construction Standards: 10/31/2025 </strong>[Microsoft Word]</a></li>
<li><a href="https://nevada.app.box.com/s/cvy841q08hevuonu0egf8rnyy1fp6mdx" class="extLink"><strong>Summary of Updates: 10/31/2025</strong>&nbsp;[Microsoft Word]</a></li>
</ul>
<h2>Request referenced drawings</h2>
<p>Facilities Services also maintains a list of referenced drawings for a variety of projects (e.g., handrails, signage, ramps, electrical installation and more). You may request referenced drawings by completing a Facilities Services form. You will receive both CAD and PDF files.</p>
<p><a href="https://nevada.formstack.com/forms/facilities_referenced_drawings_request" class="button">Request referenced drawings</a></p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <!-- end: content information -->
            <!-- start: embed form -->
            <div class="cell small-12 medium-12 large-6 medium-order-2">
                <div class="form-iframe-wrapper form-darkgray-bg">
                    <div class="fsBody fsEmbed">
                        <!-- form title -->
                        <!-- form description -->
                        <script type="text/javascript" src="https://nevada.formstack.com/forms/js.php/design_and_construction_standards"></script><noscript><a href="https://nevada.formstack.com/forms/design_and_construction_standards"></a></noscript>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <!-- end: embed form -->
        </div>
        <!-- end: panel content -->
    </div>
<!-- end: panel & form component -->
<!-- Start grid-x Content-block-->
<div class="component grid-container full cb-container">
<!--Start a content block row-->
<div class="grid-x grid-padding-x align-justify content-block cb-wrapper">



        <div class="cell small-12 medium-12 large-12 content-block   flex-container flex-dir-column cb-no-bg  ">

            

            <div class="flex-child-auto">
                <div class="cb-content NT">
                    <h2>Disclaimer</h2>
<p>No Section, Division, Appendix or Drawing stands alone. Requirements contained in sections of the document impact information contained in all Sections, Divisions, Appendices, and Drawings. It is necessary to reference the requirements noted in specific sections while following design standards in all other areas of the Facilities Services Design &amp; Construction Standards.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
</div>
<!--End content block row--> 
